<div id="@_d.I.ClassName" style="display: contents">
    <main id="main"><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap page-hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow"><a href="/jbhl">HOME</a> / HOME LOAN OPTIONS</p><h1>Plan your next property move with a clearer view.</h1><p class="hero-lead">Explore lending for an investment property with a focus on structure, repayments and your wider financial position.</p><a class="button button-lime" href="/jbhl/contact">Discuss an investment loan <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="page-hero-image" role="img" aria-label="Australian home in a landscaped garden"></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap content-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT TO CONSIDER</p><h2>Investment property loans: start with your situation.</h2><p>There is no single loan structure that suits everyone. We will talk through what you want to achieve, how a loan could fit your budget and what you should understand before applying.</p></div><div class="detail-rows"><div class="detail-row"><span>01</span><div><h3>Set out the purpose</h3><p>We discuss the property, expected deposit, other loans and how the investment fits your plans.</p></div></div><div class="detail-row"><span>02</span><div><h3>Review loan structures</h3><p>We can discuss repayment types, rate options and features in light of your goals and circumstances.</p></div></div><div class="detail-row"><span>03</span><div><h3>Understand the commitments</h3><p>Allow for vacancies, maintenance, rates and changes in interest rates when thinking through affordability.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="faq-section section"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>A few things worth knowing.</h2></div><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Can I use equity from an existing property?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>It may be possible, depending on your equity, finances and a lender’s assessment. Using equity puts that property at risk if repayments cannot be met.</p></details><details><summary>Do you provide tax advice?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. Speak with a qualified tax adviser about tax treatment before making a decision.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">A conversation can be a good start</p><h2>Let’s talk about your next step</h2><p>Tell us what you are hoping to do. Our team can help you understand the next step.</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button button-lime" href="/jbhl/contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="tel:1300795775" class="text-link light">Or call 1300 795 775</a></div></div></section></main>
</div>
